@@ -0,0 +1,24 @@
+#### Fix `//` comment being swallowed in selector lists with empty attribute values (#20305 by @fixfon)
+
+<!-- prettier-ignore -->
+```scss
+// Input
+a[href=""], // comment
+foo a[href=""] {
+  color: red;
+}
+
+// Prettier stable
+a[href=""],
+// comment foo a[href=""] {
+  color: red;
+}
+
+// Prettier main
+a[href=""], // comment
+foo a[href=""] {
+  color: red;
+}
+```
+
+_The same fix applies to Less._

